                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've put several hours into this game and I'm loving it. It's the perfect pick up and play kinda game with small enough file size that I can load it onto my computer at work. \n\nEasy to get into but very challenging at higher levels. Sound design is great, not too loud but very visceral feeling that goes well with the feedback animations that give real weight to the game.\n\nGreat stuff, I recommend it.",
